Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.98,0:14:35.25,Miracle_JP,,0,0,0,,ふたりの奇跡！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.98,0:14:35.25,Miracle_CN,,0,0,0,,兩個人的奇蹟！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.63,0:14:37.26,Miracle_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fs50\b1}キュアミラクル！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.63,0:14:37.26,Curerpp_MR,,0,0,0,,Cure Miracle !
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.63,0:14:37.26,Miracle_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fs50\b1}奇蹟愈！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.95,0:14:39.42,Magical_JP,,0,0,0,,ふたりの魔法！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.95,0:14:39.42,Magical_CN,,0,0,0,,兩個人的魔法！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.77,0:14:41.52,Magical_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fs50\b1}キュアマジカル！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.77,0:14:41.52,Curerpp_LK,,0,0,0,,Cure Magical !
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.77,0:14:41.52,Magical_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fs50\b1}魔法愈！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.34,0:14:45.87,Miracle_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fs50\b1}魔法つかい{\3c&HE479A1&\4c&H823651&}プリキュア！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.34,0:14:45.87,Curerpp_MR,,0,0,0,,Maho Girls {\3c&HE479A1&\4c&H823651&}Precure !
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.34,0:14:45.87,Miracle_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fs50\b1}魔法少女 {\3c&HE479A1&\4c&H823651&}光之美少女！
